            "review_text": "TimTs\nAuckland41 contributions\n0\nSuperb vegan food\nOct 2019 • Solo\nI've tried many vegan and vegetarian restaurants in Vietnam and most of them are good, some are excellent. This one is amongst the best. Everything I tried was fresh and delicious. There were a lot of choices, and for 150k, it's by far the best buffet I have found so far. Highly recommended.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 28, 2019",
