            "review_text": "Nana K\nKoh Tao, Thailand95 contributions\n0\nBest vegan real food in Saigon!!!\nOct 2018 • Couples\nI've been there with my boyfriend. Even he is not vegan, either not a fan of tofu but he loved it. The food is cook fresh, mild real taste Vietnamese food. Not sure about buffet if it still on. But we really enjoyed the food. The staff is super nice and polite, they are not that good in English but they try they best to give a good service! And don't forget to check it out up stairs of the building. It amazed us a lot with artificial art spiritual cafe!!!\nRead more\nWritten November 7, 2018",
