            "review_text": "Carsten Grimm\nWellington, New Zealand7 contributions\n0\nGreat Vegan Food in the Banking District of Ho Chi Minh City\nJul 2018 • Couples\nGreat vegan restaurant in the banking district of HCM City. Literally downstairs from the Air b’n’b we were staying in, the place has a buffet lunch and get this - you pay what you think is reasonable! Amazing karma. There must have been at least a dozen different choices, including tea and dessert as well.\n\nDelicious and nutritious. \n\nHighly recommended, even if vegan isn’t necessarily your thing (not mine, but my wife got to choose lunch!)\nRead more\nWritten July 24, 2018",
